<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106835" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπακ-τέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάγω</span> B) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must
				go,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				EM
				777.26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zonar.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάγω</span> A.IV. <i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>) <i>one must purge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.976
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>one must subsume,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐκεῖ ὑφ᾽ ἓν γένος τοῖς ἐνταῦθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.1.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>one must introduce</i> or <i>apply</i> (remedies), <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				5.130
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπακτέον τι τῇ χειρουργίᾳ</span>
			<i>one must subject</i> it to operation, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.25
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
